---
title: "Learn: Mortgage Basics Explained | WhatsMyMortgage.ca"
description: "Short, plain-language explainers on mortgages in Ontario — grouped by where you are: before you buy, while you own, and closing costs."
canonicalPath: "/learn/"
ogSlug: "learn"
layout: layouts/base.njk
noJs: true
intent: low
pageScript: "/assets/js/pages/analytics-lite.js"
---
{# JOB: list every explainer, grouped by where the visitor is, so they can pick one — nothing is explained here itself. #}
<div class="container-narrow" style="padding-top:var(--space-6);padding-bottom:var(--space-12)">
  <a class="back-link" href="/">← All calculators</a>
  <h1 style="margin:var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-3);font-size:var(--text-28);letter-spacing:var(--track-28)">Get to know mortgages</h1>
  <p style="font-size:var(--text-15);opacity:.75;max-width:60ch;margin:0 0 var(--space-6)">Short reads worth knowing before you touch a calculator, grouped by where you are.</p>

  {% for group in ["Before you buy", "While you own", "Closing & costs"] %}
  <h2 style="margin:var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-3);font-size:var(--text-21);letter-spacing:var(--track-21)">{{ group }}</h2>
  <div class="grid-auto-md">
    {% for a in learnArticles %}
      {% if a.group == group %}
      <a href="/learn/{{ a.slug }}/" class="card click-card" style="padding:var(--space-4);border:1px solid var(--color-divider)">
        <div class="card-title" style="font-size:var(--text-15)">{{ a.title }}</div>
        <p class="card-body" style="margin:6px 0 0">{{ a.readTime }}</p>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/mortgage-affordability-calculator/" style="margin-top:var(--space-8);display:inline-flex">Go straight to a calculator</a>
</div>
